  "title": "Air-Fried Popcorn Chicken Gizzards",
  "description": "These air fryer chicken gizzards are boiled, then seasoned with salt, black pepper, garlic powder, and paprika for a tasty appetizer or main dish.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
